#CompareFedRepos.sh 

The script compares the federated repositories between 2 JPDs and display the repo size and artifact counts from both the JPDs

Pre-requisites:

Bash Environment: A Linux or macOS environment with Bash shell.

curl: For making REST API calls to the JFrog Platform.

jq: A lightweight and flexible command-line JSON processor.

Username/Password Or JFrog Access Token:


Execution:
sh CompareFedRepos.sh "https://jpd1.jfrog.io"  "https://jpd2.jfrog.io" "username" "password"

